# Run the new migration before starting the local backend.
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3000

### Dashboard; 200 with stats and three sections with counts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard

### Only the top two books per section; total remains the full matching count
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard?limit=2

### Invalid section limit; 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard?limit=7

### Unknown filters are rejected; 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard?status=reading
